G31FL Pessim is at 35 hp.\n\
Can I kill them this turn? I have:\n\
Beast Token 4/4 (token) x2 = 8\n\
Courser 2/4 = 2\n\
Elemental 2/2 = 2\n\
Phyrexian Debaser 2/2 = 2\n\
Phyrexian Rager 2/2 = 2\n\
Rampaging Baloths 6/6 = 6\n\
